   "format": "advanced",
   "processed": "<table>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>Diagnosis</th>\n\t\t\t<th>Common Pathogens</th>\n\t\t\t<th>Drug(s) of First Choice</th>\n\t\t\t<th>Alternative Drug(s)</th>\n\t\t\t<th>Comments</th>\n\t\t\t<th>Expected Duration</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>Chronic sinusitis</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Viruses</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p><em>Strep. pneumoniae</em></p>\n\n\t\t\t<p><em>H. influenzae</em></p>\n\n\t\t\t<p><em>M. catarrhalis</em></p>\n\n\t\t\t<p>Anaerobes</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p><em>Staph. aureus</em></p>\n\t\t\tEnterobacteriacae</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p><strong><a href=\"/content/amoxicillin-clavulanate\">Amoxicillin/clavulanate</a></strong></p>\n\n\t\t\t<p>875mg/125mg PO BID</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p><em>For <a href=\"/content/allergy-beta-lactam\">severe beta-lactam allergy</a></em>:</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p><a href=\"/content/ciprofloxacin\"><strong>Ciprofloxacin </strong></a></p>\n\n\t\t\t<p>OR</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p><a href=\"/content/levofloxacin\"><strong>Levofloxacin</strong></a></p>\n\n\t\t\t<p><em>Either above WITH OR WITHOUT*:</em></p>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"/clind\"><strong>Clindamycin </strong></a></td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p align=\"left\">Otolaryngology consult recommended to rule out anatomic abnormality.</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p align=\"left\">Symptomatic relief can include acetaminophen, ibuprofen, topical intranasal steroids, and/or nasal saline irrigation</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p>If acute exacerbation, treat as acute sinusitis.</p>\n\t\t\t*Consider clindamycin if anaerobes and/or <em>Staph aureus</em> are high on the differential</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>10-14 days</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n",
   "value": "<table>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th>Diagnosis</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>Common Pathogens</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>Drug(s) of First Choice</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>Alternative Drug(s)</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>Comments</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th>Expected Duration</th>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Chronic sinusitis</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>Viruses</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><em>Strep. pneumoniae</em></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><em>H. influenzae</em></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><em>M. catarrhalis</em></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>Anaerobes</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><em>Staph. aureus</em></p>\r\n\t\t\tEnterobacteriacae</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p><strong><a href=\"/node/8311\">Amoxicillin/clavulanate</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>875mg/125mg PO BID</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p><em>For <a href=\"/node/9856\">severe beta-lactam allergy</a></em>:</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><a href=\"/node/8336\"><strong>Ciprofloxacin </strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>OR</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><a href=\"/node/8391\"><strong>Levofloxacin</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><em>Either above WITH OR WITHOUT*:</em></p>\r\n\t\t\t<a href=\"/clind\"><strong>Clindamycin </strong></a></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p align=\"left\">Otolaryngology consult recommended to rule out anatomic abnormality.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p align=\"left\">Symptomatic relief can include acetaminophen, ibuprofen, topical intranasal steroids, and/or nasal saline irrigation</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>If acute exacerbation, treat as acute sinusitis.</p>\r\n\t\t\t*Consider clindamycin if anaerobes and/or <em>Staph aureus</em> are high on the differential</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>10-14 days</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n"
